  Navigation Inc. (Uniswap Labs).
- Uniswap Permit2 interfaces (vendored subset) — MIT.
- Uniswap v3 TickMath lineage (contractsV1 PonsTickMath.sol) —
  GPL-2.0-or-later. NOT MIT-licensed; V1-only, not in the V2 build path.
- forge-std (test-only submodule) — MIT OR Apache-2.0.
- v4-hooks-public BaseHook.sol — MIT SPDX header; upstream origin unresolved
  (see docs/LICENSE-INVENTORY.md §2).

SPDX headers in each vendored file are authoritative for that file.
